           1   Foreign

   Variables:  foreign


. 
. * 3.5 egen 分组汇总
. egen mean_price_all = mean(price)

. bysort foreign: egen mean_price_by_origin = mean(price)

. 
. * 3.6 压缩存储
. compress
  variable mpg was int now byte
  variable rep78 was int now byte
  variable trunk was int now byte
  variable turn was int now byte
  variable high_mpg was float now byte
  variable make_id was long now byte
  variable make was str18 now str17
  (814 bytes saved)

. 
. *---- 第 4 章：do-file 结果管理 —— 保存清洗后的数据 --------
. save "data/auto_clean.dta", replace
file data/auto_clean.dta saved

. 
